<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-suzukii-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Drosophila suzukii Turing onset wavelength at 2.046 µm (0 Ma, detail scale) — Code-to-model traceability: 88/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "onset_kc2, growth_rate, the eigenvector initializer, and the chronoseries constants are the same objects the Lean file proves as sign facts (trace < 0, det > 0, 12 vs 10 ocelli, f_u numerator -17). The math-kg yaml points at those declarations. Comments name Turing 1952 and Schnakenberg 1979 at the formula, not only in the module docstring." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-code-traceability> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/code-traceability" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-suzukii-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-suzukii-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability-2> ;
    pk:hasScore 8.8e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-suzukii-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Drosophila suzukii Turing onset wavelength at 2.046 µm (0 Ma, detail scale) — Model fidelity to source: 88/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "The script implements Schnakenberg kinetics, the onset formula k_c^2 = (D_v f_u + D_u g_v) / (2 D_u D_v), and sigma(k) from the reaction-diffusion matrix. D_u is solved so lambda_c = 2.046 µm exactly (self-test tolerance 1e-9). Numerical sigma now follows the least-stable eigenvector, which is the comparison the linear law requires. The rates themselves are calibrated, not taken from a yellow/ebony measurement, so this is not a 95." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-suzukii-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-suzukii-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-suzukii-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-3> ;
    pk:hasScore 8.8e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-suzukii-turing-wavelength-s0-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Drosophila suzukii Turing onset wavelength at 2.046 µm (0 Ma, detail scale) — Morphometric validation: 88/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Dispersion Pearson r = 0.9999999995, RMSE = 4.16e-4 per time unit (reference for r is the null of 0, not a copy of the result). Stripe-seed mean spacing is 2.046 µm with CV 0.056, against the fastest-growing wavelength 2.116 µm, so the value is not the reference. Labyrinth CV stays 0.37 and KS stays 0.63; that gap is reported, not tuned away. Specimen foreground 0.203 vs prior 0.40, melanin 0.028 vs 0.10, left-minus-right darkness -5.28 vs 0, abdominal troughs 7 vs 6, coherency 0.375 vs 0.50. Ablation std ratio is about 1e-15 versus a reference of 1." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/morphometric-validation" ;
